      "element": "429:0",
      "role": "Figure",
      "page": 5,
      "alt": "RunEx query interface. Selecting code tokens creates generalized patterns. Filters can constrain runtime values, such as type(v) is str, and variable names, such as len(n)>2. Queries can be combined using set operations, including complementing a selected loop pattern, and nested to find constructs such as iteration over set(v0). The two result panels show matching code with the corresponding expressions highlighted.",
